# Godot's import cache and generated data — rebuilt on first open, never committed.
.godot/
*.import

# export_presets.cfg IS tracked, on purpose (2026-09-12). It carries the web build's head script:
# the AudioContext unlock shim and navigator.audioSession.type = 'playback'. Both ARE the audio fix
# (docs/OPEN_ISSUES.md 34 and 44). While this file was ignored they lived on one Mac only, so a
# fresh clone would have exported a silent game with nothing in the repository to explain why.
# It holds no keys, passwords or personal paths — checked before tracking it.

# Build output
build/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.pck
*.zip

# Scratch and review artefacts
_critic_tmp/
*.log
*.tmp

# macOS
.DS_Store

# THIRD-PARTY REFERENCE IMAGES — not ours to redistribute.
# reference/ holds Animal Crossing screenshots and stock astronaut artwork used only as art
# direction while building. They are excluded so the repository contains nothing we do not own.
# docs/STYLE_GUIDE.md describes what they showed, so the guidance survives without the files.
reference/

# Web export output. It is published on the gh-pages branch, not committed to main:
# keeping it here also made Godot scan its PNGs and litter the folder with .import files.
docs_build/
